1
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:15,550
♪I lean and gaze at misty waves afar♪

2
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:18,320
♪Tears fall on the ancient road
'neath the setting sun♪

3
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:21,460
♪One lone shadow on the cold river♪

4
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,910
♪In dreams, I return to the old window♪

5
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:28,670
♪Mountains stretch, the road home fades♪

6
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:32,030
♪A flute cries out, hooves hurry on♪

7
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:34,790
♪My heart adrift beneath a frosted moon♪

8
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:38,220
♪Drinking alone, I mourn our parting♪

9
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:40,050
♪Night turns cold, wind stirs the veil♪

10
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,760
♪Old robes recall forgotten days♪

11
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,570
♪Heart sore, a lone goose flies south♪

12
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,230
♪Where shall I send this letter?♪

13
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:47,760
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

14
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:49,000
♪Love runs deep, dreams linger on♪

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,390
♪Only sorrow remains♪

16
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,340
♪A cup of wine, my shadow makes us two♪

17
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:54,980
♪Drunk and lost through flashing blades♪

18
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:56,870
♪I curse how swiftly the years pass by♪

19
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,580
♪The wandering road goes on♪

20
00:00:58,590 --> 00:01:01,020
♪Desolate, time frosts my youthful hair♪

21
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:02,340
♪Through the years, love still burns♪

22
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:04,530
♪A thousand tears fall♪

23
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:08,030
♪Worlds apart, tears stain my sleeves♪

24
00:01:08,150 --> 00:01:11,300
♪Old dreams haunt my heart,
tears cloud my eyes♪

25
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:13,340
♪Heartbroken, soul-worn,
pain won't fade♪

26
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:14,820
♪Moonlight westward, the night drags on♪

27
00:01:14,830 --> 00:01:17,920
♪The years have left their scars♪

28
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:21,280
♪Autumn winds sweep leaves;
shadows pair♪

29
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:24,590
♪The past fades like smoke;
tears fall♪

30
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:26,820
♪My heart lies broken♪

31
00:01:26,830 --> 00:01:30,150
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

32
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:34,980
[Love Legend]

33
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:38,780
[Episode 12]

34
00:01:39,040 --> 00:01:39,730
Spare me, my lord.

35
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:40,680
I'm just an errand boy.

36
00:01:40,680 --> 00:01:41,510
I don't know anything.

37
00:01:42,130 --> 00:01:42,990
This blade

38
00:01:43,450 --> 00:01:44,590
is made of blood jade.

39
00:01:45,070 --> 00:01:47,090
One cut

40
00:01:47,710 --> 00:01:49,380
and your flesh will rot.

41
00:01:49,860 --> 00:01:50,990
You'll beg

42
00:01:51,470 --> 00:01:52,720
to die.

43
00:01:53,230 --> 00:01:54,790
I'll confess. All of it.

44
00:01:56,640 --> 00:01:57,200
Speak.

45
00:01:57,870 --> 00:01:58,430
They've

46
00:01:58,560 --> 00:01:59,840
been doing this for 18 years.

47
00:02:01,430 --> 00:02:02,430
Eighteen years?

48
00:02:02,940 --> 00:02:03,840
My father was a jade craftsman.

49
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:05,620
They took him 18 years ago

50
00:02:05,780 --> 00:02:06,710
and made him carve white-jade plates.

51
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:09,080
If the blood

52
00:02:09,620 --> 00:02:10,150
of the kidnapped baby girls

53
00:02:10,390 --> 00:02:11,430
was absorbed by the plate,

54
00:02:12,100 --> 00:02:13,920
they were secretly raised
in the capital.

55
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:15,500
If not,

56
00:02:17,010 --> 00:02:17,960
they were killed.

57
00:02:18,840 --> 00:02:19,400
But,

58
00:02:19,630 --> 00:02:22,150
girls raised from infancy
were top-grade.

59
00:02:22,150 --> 00:02:23,310
The rest were inferior

60
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:24,960
and sold for less.

61
00:02:25,530 --> 00:02:26,720
Animals.

62
00:02:28,680 --> 00:02:29,190
Speak.

63
00:02:30,020 --> 00:02:31,430
What did they do with those girls?

64
00:02:33,060 --> 00:02:33,790
Hold Blood Banquets.

65
00:02:36,080 --> 00:02:36,870
Blood Banquets?

66
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:40,000
They say Blood Banquets can prolong life

67
00:02:40,590 --> 00:02:41,470
and preserve youth.

68
00:02:42,530 --> 00:02:43,510
Who were the buyers?

69
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:45,680
These symbols

70
00:02:46,010 --> 00:02:46,870
mark the buyers.

71
00:02:57,870 --> 00:02:59,230
Is this the Yun family in the capital?

72
00:03:00,710 --> 00:03:02,120
I don't know which Yun family,

73
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:03,840
but they're a major buyer.

74
00:03:03,990 --> 00:03:06,000
They've taken at least 18 girls
over the past 20 years.

75
00:03:06,460 --> 00:03:07,010
What was different

76
00:03:07,010 --> 00:03:08,710
about these girls as they grew up?

77
00:03:09,400 --> 00:03:10,750
At first,

78
00:03:10,750 --> 00:03:12,530
they tattooed a drop of blood
on each neck.

79
00:03:17,150 --> 00:03:18,360
But when supplies ran low,

80
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,280
they stopped.

81
00:03:20,120 --> 00:03:20,750
Still,

82
00:03:20,750 --> 00:03:22,840
to keep their blood pure,

83
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:24,800
they were fed only vegetables.

84
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:26,120
No meat at all.

85
00:03:26,610 --> 00:03:27,360
Only vegetables...

86
00:03:30,910 --> 00:03:33,240
So I was always meant to be sacrificed.

87
00:03:53,550 --> 00:03:54,700
If I hadn't

88
00:03:55,500 --> 00:03:57,310
escaped the altar,

89
00:03:59,420 --> 00:04:01,240
I'd probably be like them,

90
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,560
buried here without a thought.

91
00:04:07,710 --> 00:04:08,520
You wouldn't.

92
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:10,870
You're smart.

93
00:04:14,350 --> 00:04:15,700
That's the first time you've praised me.

94
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:20,000
I just wonder

95
00:04:21,830 --> 00:04:23,680
where my real parents are.

96
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:28,190
Sir.

97
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:29,510
Sir.

98
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:30,360
Sir.

99
00:04:31,430 --> 00:04:32,630
I knew you'd be here.

100
00:04:36,210 --> 00:04:38,690
Why does Madam Xu look so upset?

101
00:04:39,780 --> 00:04:41,870
Sir, stop scolding Madam Xu.

102
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:43,160
She's already doing great.

103
00:04:43,820 --> 00:04:44,530
Chang'an.

104
00:04:46,270 --> 00:04:47,170
Go clean up the site.

105
00:04:48,380 --> 00:04:48,730
Go.

106
00:04:51,850 --> 00:04:52,510
Sir.

107
00:04:52,510 --> 00:04:53,510
We still need to secure the scene

108
00:04:53,510 --> 00:04:54,430
and gather evidence.

109
00:04:54,430 --> 00:04:55,430
I'll go find Chang'an and the others.

110
00:05:09,750 --> 00:05:10,360
You promised me

111
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:11,360
you wouldn't hurt innocent people.

112
00:05:12,510 --> 00:05:13,360
And you promised me

113
00:05:13,830 --> 00:05:15,000
you'd never forget our blood debt.

114
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:16,380
What about now?

115
00:05:16,870 --> 00:05:17,390
What is this?

116
00:05:17,720 --> 00:05:19,370
You like being a Fengyi Guard that much?

117
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:21,000
What about those girls?

118
00:05:21,310 --> 00:05:22,750
You knew they were innocent.

119
00:05:22,950 --> 00:05:24,360
Yet watched them slain and bled.

120
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:25,870
Can your conscience bear it?

121
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:30,480
When our whole family was torn apart,

122
00:05:30,870 --> 00:05:32,560
did anyone care about us?

123
00:05:33,870 --> 00:05:34,600
Since that is so,

124
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:37,070
what are others' lives to me?

125
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:39,920
Right.

126
00:05:40,750 --> 00:05:42,720
You missed the treasure beside you.

127
00:05:43,750 --> 00:05:44,680
What do you mean?

128
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:46,240
Madam Xu

129
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:47,920
is the younger Lady Yun.

130
00:05:48,770 --> 00:05:49,480
Yun Shao.

131
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:53,040
I'm going to kill her.

132
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:54,430
No way you can stop me.

133
00:06:05,750 --> 00:06:06,420
Sir.

134
00:06:08,290 --> 00:06:09,090
Where were you?

135
00:06:13,430 --> 00:06:14,630
Just looking around.

136
00:06:17,830 --> 00:06:18,950
It's my fault I was late.

137
00:06:19,950 --> 00:06:21,070
But I never expected

138
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:22,870
that before we reached the pier,

139
00:06:23,390 --> 00:06:24,560
they had men lying in wait.

140
00:06:24,950 --> 00:06:26,610
We were ambushed on arrival.

141
00:06:27,190 --> 00:06:28,580
Our whereabouts were leaked.

142
00:06:29,820 --> 00:06:31,000
Were we being followed?

143
00:06:31,370 --> 00:06:32,360
Could it be the Crown Prince?

144
00:06:35,910 --> 00:06:37,230
Just looking around?

145
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:48,000
Sir, she had no part in this.

146
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:50,070
I should have seen it sooner.

147
00:06:50,750 --> 00:06:52,270
I trusted you too much.

148
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:56,310
Sir.

149
00:06:57,430 --> 00:06:58,630
I had no choice.

150
00:06:59,040 --> 00:07:00,110
Fourteen years ago,

151
00:07:00,480 --> 00:07:01,430
the Qingluan Xiao clan

152
00:07:01,700 --> 00:07:03,250
failed to protect the Blood Jade Mine

153
00:07:03,460 --> 00:07:04,830
and was expelled from the lineage.

154
00:07:05,290 --> 00:07:06,310
Their son, Xiao Ruoming,

155
00:07:06,500 --> 00:07:07,460
and daughter, Xiao Ruoli,

156
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:08,730
were demoted to the Wingless.

157
00:07:09,060 --> 00:07:10,390
The rest were hanged.

158
00:07:11,750 --> 00:07:13,460
The Fengyi Bureau
made an exception for you.

159
00:07:13,830 --> 00:07:14,680
And you

160
00:07:14,680 --> 00:07:15,630
have spent all these years

161
00:07:15,630 --> 00:07:17,600
secretly feeding info to the rebels.

162
00:07:17,690 --> 00:07:18,960
You even sacrificed fellow members

163
00:07:18,960 --> 00:07:20,000
and lured the Crown Prince here.

164
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:22,630
How could you betray

165
00:07:23,480 --> 00:07:24,960
everyone's trust?

166
00:07:27,520 --> 00:07:29,000
The Yun family framed my father.

167
00:07:30,100 --> 00:07:31,490
The Gu royal family deserves to die.

168
00:07:32,310 --> 00:07:33,560
The Yun family even more.

169
00:07:34,190 --> 00:07:34,790
Yun Shao.

170
00:07:35,250 --> 00:07:36,420
I will kill you.

171
00:07:36,430 --> 00:07:37,690
I will kill you!

172
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:43,830
I'm going to kill her.

173
00:07:44,390 --> 00:07:45,390
No way you can stop me.

174
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:49,890
Harder.

175
00:07:49,950 --> 00:07:50,380
Brother.

176
00:07:54,270 --> 00:07:54,860
Brother!

177
00:07:55,140 --> 00:07:56,120
Harder.

178
00:07:56,570 --> 00:07:57,150
Sir.

179
00:07:57,800 --> 00:07:59,240
Ruoming has risked all for years.

180
00:07:59,520 --> 00:08:00,380
He would never betray us.

181
00:08:00,390 --> 00:08:00,890
Brother.

182
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:01,950
Keep going.

183
00:08:02,750 --> 00:08:03,560
Sir.

184
00:08:05,270 --> 00:08:05,920
Sir.

185
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:07,660
Brother.

186
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:08,360
Sir.

187
00:08:10,510 --> 00:08:11,110
Brother.

188
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:12,400
This lash

189
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:13,830
is for betraying your own.

190
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:16,120
Eleven Fengyi Guards died today.

191
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:16,830
Because of you.

192
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:18,240
Pei Zhao.

193
00:08:19,410 --> 00:08:21,160
I made the deal with Mingyu.

194
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:22,270
I lured the Crown Prince here.

195
00:08:22,440 --> 00:08:23,480
My brother had nothing to do with it.

196
00:08:24,100 --> 00:08:25,240
Don't strike him.

197
00:08:29,290 --> 00:08:30,160
This lash

198
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:32,080
is for helping evil.

199
00:08:32,630 --> 00:08:34,030
Twenty-nine innocent girls

200
00:08:34,210 --> 00:08:35,910
died because of your selfishness.

201
00:08:37,630 --> 00:08:38,150
Brother.

202
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:40,200
Sir.

203
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:44,510
And this lash

204
00:08:45,480 --> 00:08:45,910
is for

205
00:08:45,910 --> 00:08:46,630
your hesitation

206
00:08:46,630 --> 00:08:47,670
and indecision.

207
00:08:47,670 --> 00:08:48,720
You'll never achieve anything like that.

208
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:53,200
Sir.

209
00:08:53,750 --> 00:08:54,630
Please stop.

210
00:08:54,930 --> 00:08:55,870
Hit me instead.

211
00:08:55,910 --> 00:08:57,330
You'll kill him.

212
00:08:59,010 --> 00:08:59,990
Chang'an.

213
00:09:01,700 --> 00:09:03,270
Let him.

214
00:09:04,770 --> 00:09:05,630
It was me.

215
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:09,480
I betrayed our own men

216
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:12,140
and got our brothers killed.

217
00:09:13,270 --> 00:09:13,660
Sir.

218
00:09:14,390 --> 00:09:15,490
Ruoming knows he was wrong.

219
00:09:16,270 --> 00:09:17,270
Please stop.

220
00:09:18,390 --> 00:09:19,510
I grew up without parents.

221
00:09:20,440 --> 00:09:21,750
Since I joined Fengyi Bureau,

222
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:24,080
I finally felt loved.

223
00:09:25,790 --> 00:09:27,270
Ruoming is my real brother to me.

224
00:09:28,030 --> 00:09:29,320
Hit me instead.

225
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:36,510
Sir.

226
00:09:37,630 --> 00:09:38,720
Spare Ruoming.

227
00:09:40,510 --> 00:09:41,150
Sir.

228
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:42,030
Please spare him.

229
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:59,080
Xiao Ruoming.

230
00:10:00,390 --> 00:10:01,270
Killed in action.

231
00:10:03,870 --> 00:10:04,750
Ruoming.

232
00:10:14,870 --> 00:10:15,390
Move out.

233
00:10:30,390 --> 00:10:31,000
Brother.

234
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:31,600
Don't kneel.

235
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:34,080
You...

236
00:11:08,570 --> 00:11:10,150
Pei Zhao is out of control.

237
00:11:10,480 --> 00:11:11,460
He let the rebels go.

238
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:14,600
Did you hear

239
00:11:14,850 --> 00:11:16,390
what that rebel woman called Guard Xu?

240
00:11:16,980 --> 00:11:18,360
Something like

241
00:11:19,100 --> 00:11:19,910
Yun Shao.

242
00:11:22,120 --> 00:11:24,150
Yun Shao is the younger Lady Yun.

243
00:11:24,870 --> 00:11:27,320
I never heard a Yun daughter was lost.

244
00:11:27,750 --> 00:11:29,030
Why hide her name

245
00:11:29,250 --> 00:11:30,630
and stay in the Fengyi Bureau?

246
00:11:32,910 --> 00:11:34,870
Could the Yuns be tied to the rebels?

247
00:11:36,080 --> 00:11:36,600
Your Highness.

248
00:11:36,960 --> 00:11:37,960
Something's off.

249
00:11:38,180 --> 00:11:39,500
We should bring her in for questioning.

250
00:11:40,600 --> 00:11:41,840
She said I was kind.

251
00:11:42,540 --> 00:11:43,220
What?

252
00:11:45,350 --> 00:11:46,670
I have a kind heart.

253
00:11:47,270 --> 00:11:48,750
You should learn some kindness too.

254
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:18,720
Back straight. Legs firm. Arm steady.

255
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:19,790
Sir.

256
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:33,550
If you're going to practice,

257
00:12:33,550 --> 00:12:34,300
do it properly.

258
00:12:41,870 --> 00:12:42,670
Hold it tight.

259
00:12:53,970 --> 00:12:55,200
You're teaching me?

260
00:12:55,200 --> 00:12:56,120
Focus.

261
00:12:58,180 --> 00:12:58,610
Release.

262
00:13:06,670 --> 00:13:07,120
Sir.

263
00:13:07,870 --> 00:13:08,750
I know a way

264
00:13:08,750 --> 00:13:10,690
to prove the link
between Mingyu and the Yuns.

265
00:13:11,320 --> 00:13:12,910
Please take me back to Yun Mansion.

266
00:13:13,150 --> 00:13:18,080
- Long live His Majesty.
- Long live His Majesty.

267
00:13:18,080 --> 00:13:19,080
Mingyu confessed.

268
00:13:19,390 --> 00:13:20,240
Blood sacrifices

269
00:13:20,240 --> 00:13:21,130
are popular among nobles in the capital.

270
00:13:22,640 --> 00:13:24,290
[Gu Changyuan, Emperor of Yong]
They sacrifice girls' blood

271
00:13:24,320 --> 00:13:25,000
for wealth and fortune.

272
00:13:26,200 --> 00:13:27,440
At Mingyu's altar,

273
00:13:27,600 --> 00:13:28,840
I found many blood-jade vessels.

274
00:13:29,430 --> 00:13:31,600
Mingyu abducted
injured blood-jade craftsmen

275
00:13:31,840 --> 00:13:33,910
and forced them
to keep carving blood jade

276
00:13:34,110 --> 00:13:34,790
for their use.

277
00:13:36,630 --> 00:13:37,000
Your Majesty.

278
00:13:37,670 --> 00:13:38,910
I also rescued a woman

279
00:13:39,120 --> 00:13:40,120
from Mingyu's altar.

280
00:13:41,210 --> 00:13:42,420
I ask Your Majesty

281
00:13:42,420 --> 00:13:43,290
to summon her before you.

282
00:13:44,600 --> 00:13:45,150
Summon her.

283
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:48,630
The woman may enter.

284
00:14:06,350 --> 00:14:07,490
Greetings, Your Majesty.

285
00:14:07,960 --> 00:14:10,260
Long live Your Majesty.

286
00:14:11,140 --> 00:14:11,910
Rise.

287
00:14:23,570 --> 00:14:24,960
Remove your veil.

288
00:14:37,780 --> 00:14:38,940
[Empress Duanyi]

289
00:14:43,120 --> 00:14:43,750
Lord Yun.

290
00:14:44,870 --> 00:14:45,840
Do you recognize her?

291
00:14:54,960 --> 00:14:55,630
Shao?

292
00:14:57,320 --> 00:14:58,550
You're finally back.

293
00:14:59,480 --> 00:15:00,200
After you disappeared,

294
00:15:00,670 --> 00:15:02,670
your mother nearly wept herself blind.

295
00:15:03,510 --> 00:15:04,240
I...

296
00:15:04,720 --> 00:15:05,960
don't remember anything.

297
00:15:12,150 --> 00:15:14,030
The younger Lady Yun
was held in Mingyu's dungeon.

298
00:15:14,480 --> 00:15:15,550
When I found her,

299
00:15:15,840 --> 00:15:16,910
she had already lost her memory.

300
00:15:21,120 --> 00:15:21,720
Father.

301
00:15:24,360 --> 00:15:25,630
If they dare take a Yun daughter,

302
00:15:25,960 --> 00:15:27,440
they can take daughters from any family,

303
00:15:28,080 --> 00:15:29,150
even noble ladies

304
00:15:29,320 --> 00:15:30,120
for blood sacrifices.

305
00:15:31,910 --> 00:15:33,360
Your Majesty,

306
00:15:33,550 --> 00:15:34,670
please investigate this thoroughly.

307
00:15:36,270 --> 00:15:37,790
- I concur.
- I concur.

308
00:15:39,200 --> 00:15:40,480
I concur.

309
00:15:42,760 --> 00:15:44,270
It's only Mingyu.

310
00:15:44,270 --> 00:15:46,030
Why make such a fuss?

311
00:15:46,620 --> 00:15:48,930
Prince of Xin'an has returned.

312
00:16:06,260 --> 00:16:08,540
[Imperial Study]

313
00:16:09,840 --> 00:16:11,080
My younger daughter

314
00:16:11,270 --> 00:16:12,270
was abducted

315
00:16:12,480 --> 00:16:13,630
two months ago.

316
00:16:14,220 --> 00:16:14,910
I feared

317
00:16:14,910 --> 00:16:16,440
for her reputation,

318
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:17,600
so I said nothing

319
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:20,000
and searched in secret.

320
00:16:21,550 --> 00:16:22,510
Life matters less

321
00:16:22,790 --> 00:16:23,600
than a woman's honor.

322
00:16:24,180 --> 00:16:26,320
Lord Yun's caution has reason.

323
00:16:26,760 --> 00:16:28,390
Of course life matters more.

324
00:16:31,030 --> 00:16:31,600
Father.

325
00:16:32,810 --> 00:16:33,510
I personally

326
00:16:33,630 --> 00:16:35,200
saw those girls

327
00:16:35,360 --> 00:16:36,550
drained and dismembered.

328
00:16:37,250 --> 00:16:39,200
If Mingyu isn't wiped out,

329
00:16:39,630 --> 00:16:41,550
everyone in the capital

330
00:16:41,550 --> 00:16:42,510
will live in fear.

331
00:16:44,790 --> 00:16:47,150
That depends.

332
00:16:48,230 --> 00:16:49,080
If it's

333
00:16:49,550 --> 00:16:50,910
the Wingless,

334
00:16:50,910 --> 00:16:52,030
so what if they die?

335
00:16:53,480 --> 00:16:54,240
In my view,

336
00:16:54,750 --> 00:16:56,360
Mingyu should be left

337
00:16:56,630 --> 00:16:58,000
to the Capital Prefecture.

338
00:16:59,480 --> 00:17:01,200
Your Highness, you risked yourself.

339
00:17:01,550 --> 00:17:02,580
That was reckless.

340
00:17:02,790 --> 00:17:03,540
I hope

341
00:17:03,550 --> 00:17:05,640
you will put the realm first

342
00:17:06,070 --> 00:17:08,000
and not do it again.

343
00:17:08,240 --> 00:17:09,160
Prince of Xin'an.

344
00:17:10,510 --> 00:17:12,480
You dare lecture me now?

345
00:17:15,790 --> 00:17:16,240
Pei Zhao.

346
00:17:16,550 --> 00:17:17,110
What are you doing?

347
00:17:17,640 --> 00:17:18,160
Say something.

348
00:17:19,680 --> 00:17:20,880
It is the Fengyi Bureau's duty

349
00:17:21,240 --> 00:17:22,000
to investigate anything,

350
00:17:22,220 --> 00:17:23,030
anyone, anywhere.

351
00:17:23,350 --> 00:17:24,160
If we mean to investigate,

352
00:17:24,270 --> 00:17:25,310
nothing is off-limits.

353
00:17:26,030 --> 00:17:26,650
We will

354
00:17:26,930 --> 00:17:28,690
see this case through.

355
00:17:33,830 --> 00:17:36,070
I've had headaches lately.

356
00:17:37,680 --> 00:17:39,590
My vision is failing too.

357
00:17:40,070 --> 00:17:41,240
Let me

358
00:17:41,720 --> 00:17:44,030
rest for a while.

359
00:17:45,480 --> 00:17:46,680
As for this affair,

360
00:17:48,360 --> 00:17:49,640
handle it as you see fit.

361
00:17:50,370 --> 00:17:51,550
I'm tired.

362
00:17:52,640 --> 00:17:53,400
You may leave.

363
00:18:07,590 --> 00:18:08,920
Tell Pei Zhao.

364
00:18:09,700 --> 00:18:11,280
Find out who's behind the unrest.

365
00:18:12,350 --> 00:18:13,830
He may execute first, report afterward.

366
00:18:27,200 --> 00:18:30,010
♪A cold blade gleams by the window♪

367
00:18:31,630 --> 00:18:34,820
♪Candle tears harden into frost♪

368
00:18:36,140 --> 00:18:37,880
♪Moon shadows flicker and sway♪

369
00:18:38,380 --> 00:18:42,820
♪A wisp of longing haunts the air♪

370
00:18:44,980 --> 00:18:47,650
♪A lone boat rests on the misty river♪

371
00:18:48,870 --> 00:18:53,880
♪That promise lies sealed with my sword♪

372
00:18:54,200 --> 00:19:02,230
♪I turn to find the world in snow♪

373
00:19:02,500 --> 00:19:11,120
♪Fated destiny ties from bygone life♪

374
00:19:11,120 --> 00:19:19,790
♪Longing for one beloved flows on♪

375
00:19:20,170 --> 00:19:29,040
♪I can't let go of the verses lost
across this vast land♪

376
00:19:29,470 --> 00:19:37,960
♪Yet I let go of that fleeting light
within your eyes♪
